# node-exporter textfile collector drop zone. Host cron jobs (e.g.
# scripts/backup-postgres.sh) write *.prom here; node-exporter reads it
# read-only via the bind mount in docker-compose.observability.yml.
#
# The directory itself is committed (via this file) so the bind mount has a
# user-owned target after a fresh clone — otherwise Docker creates it root-owned
# and the non-root cron user can't write. The metric files are runtime state.
*.prom
*.tmp
!.gitignore
